sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor User as Operator
  participant Browser as Duck Viewer
  participant API as FastAPI routes
  participant WS as WebSocket /ws
  participant LabLoop as 50 Hz lab_loop
  participant Duck as Duck and environment
  participant Job as TrainingJob
  participant Trainer as train_behavior
  User->>Browser: Open http://127.0.0.1:63317
  Browser->>API: GET /scene
  API-->>Browser: meshes, geoms, bodies
  Browser->>API: GET /policies
  API-->>Browser: pollen, runs, checkpoints
  Browser->>WS: Connect
  loop Every 20 ms
    LabLoop->>Duck: set command, infer, env.step
    Duck-->>LabLoop: pose and telemetry
  end
  loop Every 2 ticks
    LabLoop-->>WS: Frame at 25 Hz
    WS-->>Browser: cmd, ducks, stats, training, events
  end
  User->>Browser: Assign, spawn, or reset
  Browser->>WS: assign or spawn_duck or reset
  WS->>Duck: hot-swap, create, or reset
  User->>Browser: Teach a behavior
  Browser->>API: POST /teach
  API->>Job: Create curriculum job and preview Duck
  Job->>Trainer: Launch subprocess with 32 envs
  loop Configured snapshot cadence
    Trainer-->>Job: progress.jsonl and atomic live.onnx
    LabLoop->>Job: Poll at about 1 Hz
    Job->>Duck: Hot-load snapshot for trainee and helpers
    LabLoop-->>Browser: Frame with updated training state
  end
